msgid ""
"Provides a overview of connected hardware from a parameter file or log. If a"
" log is used, more information can be provided, such as sensor health status"
" and exact firmware version. A range of options are available to extract "
"mission, lua scripts used, and parameters from logs: all, only changed, or "
"minimal removing calibration parameters. Includes visualization for sensor "
"position offsets."
msgstr ""
"从参数文件或日志提供所连接硬件的概览。使用日志时可提供更多信息，如传感器健康状态和确切固件版本。提供多种选项从日志中提取任务、Lua "
"脚本和参数：全部、仅变更项或最小集（排除校准参数）。包含传感器位置偏移的可视化。"

