msgid ""
"Gyro noise and filter configuration tool. Uses raw or batch IMU logs to show"
" the vehicle's noise profile. Filters can be applied to logged pre-filter "
"data to see the effect without the need to fly again. Advanced user tool, "
"more instructions on use coming."
msgstr ""
"陀螺仪噪声和滤波器配置工具。使用原始或批量 IMU "
"日志显示飞行器的噪声分布。可将滤波器应用于记录的预滤波数据以预览效果，无需再次飞行。高级用户工具，更多使用说明待补充。"

